    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A story about dignity...</h2></strong><br><br>A young, ambitious pigeon named Lord Crumbs seeks to stop pigeons from being a joke. In order to do this, there's only one true way of earning respect amongst bird kind... through the Kings of Wings Tournament!  A very, very, veeeery dangerous survival race in which only the best of the best can get to the top.<br><br>In order to become the most respected bird in history, Lord Crumbs must defeat:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Chuck: A little but energic chick.<br></li><li>Mr. Killer: A ferocious vulture.<br></li><li>Dr. Penguin: The smartest bird alive.<br></li><li>The Boss: The mighty and powerful eagle, who's dominated the tournament for centuries.</li></ul><br>Can Lord Crumbs get to the top or will he reaffirm that pigeons are nothing but jokes?",
